{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Deepest Dungeons, a rogue-like adventure with extraction elements, you will descend into the depths of an ever-changing labyrinth. The maze shifts with each venture, challenging your resolve as you delve deeper into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a young adventurer who follows the king's call to reclaim the valuable runes stolen by mysterious monsters from the depths. With only the courage in your heart and the gear you gather along the way, you must survive the relentless dangers of the dungeons and explore the deeper levels to bring back what was taken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Exploration.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore, you'll face powerful creatures, deadly traps, and uncover hidden treasures. To reach deeper levels of the dungeon, you'll need to find special keys hidden within. Along the way, you'll discover rare items and equipment to enhance your survivability, giving you the edge needed to pull through the dangers below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Procedural_Mazes.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon is a unique maze filled with its own set of challenges and dangers. As you descend further, the mazes grow larger and demand greater use of your wits and the tools you've discovered to navigate and locate the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Extraction.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, you'll come across exits that lead out of the dungeon. It's your choice: return to the surface to save your progress in the <i>Stashbox</i> and reorganize yourself, or continue deeper into the dungeons, risking everything for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Equipment_Items.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you venture through the dungeons, you'll come across gear and items, left behind by those who ventured before you, that enhance your abilities in combat but also provide crucial advantages as you navigate the dungeon\u2019s twisting corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Enemies.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeons are filled with lurking monsters and deadly traps. As an untrained adventurer from the countryside, each enemy you face requires special attention. The deeper you go, the more threatening the monsters become. Stay alert - every encounter could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Death.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death isn't the end. While you'll lose your progress, the items in your Stashbox from previous runs can aid your next attempt. Learn, adapt, and descend again, growing stronger with each fall. <br>And for those who conquer the depths, a new challenge awaits - <strong>New Game Plus</strong> lets you dive back in with enhanced difficulty, offering new dangers.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/e4bd0a113a9fce2d5665b02cffd4db82ae6ec503.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/d31b23bc4d2e3e1958198209d4da1c0e805c9e31.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/02532d3ba38d7377efd7184365234ae58097c792.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeon Diver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/90e1b6797429ae06316392f9b809ac4975193abe.jpg"},{"name":"Sanctuary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/388b80e062e5cab3e852c6c406ea7fbe31d3c397.jpg"},{"name":"Nowhere is safe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/31cd0dff8852e815153a883d4b7560e58dc3cfbf.jpg"},{"name":"Sealed Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/48fa4be36a1ebde768bc47824cad7e13cca99ab0.jpg"},{"name":"Chunk Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/124d543b01b4ffcffb84ed6b24ed64cc314fd383.jpg"},{"name":"Back Into the Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/a87b105df4ef0767a146f78c277024ffb9223d15.jpg"},{"name":"Power Unleashed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3137960/e48c3f0a3f37244f933969a976e01d327d645f19.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137960?t=1744102872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137960?t=1744102872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/b05edffff5995c7095cee550991f802d78c31165/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1