72\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon is a unique maze filled with its own set of challenges and dangers. As you descend further, the mazes grow larger and demand greater use of your wits and the tools you've discovered to navigate and locate the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Extraction.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, you'll come across exits that lead out of the dungeon. It's your choice: return to the surface to save your progress in the <i>Stashbox</i> and reorganize yourself, or continue deeper into the dungeons, risking everything for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Equipment_Items.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you venture through the dungeons, you'll come across gear and items, left behind by those who ventured before you, that enhance your abilities in combat but also provide crucial advantages as you navigate the dungeon\u2019s twisting corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Enemies.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeons are filled with lurking monsters and deadly traps. As an untrained adventurer from the countryside, each enemy you face requires special attention. The deeper you go, the more threatening the monsters become. Stay alert - every encounter could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/extras/Section_Banner_Death.png?t=1744102872\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death isn't the end. While you'll lose your progress, the items in your Stashbox from previous runs can aid your next attempt. Learn, adapt, and descend again, growing stronger with each fall. <br>And for those who conquer the depths, a new challenge awaits - <strong>New Game Plus</strong> lets you dive back in with enhanced difficulty, offering new dangers.</p>","developers":["Unmade Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137960/header.jpg?t=1744102872","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120958,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120958/movie480.mp4?t=1743512381","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120958/movie_max.mp4?t=1743512381"},"name":"GameplayTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120958/be71fbad8138831c99d41bc6aee423ac1c01b14e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743512381","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120958/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743512381","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120958/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743512381"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257113347,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113347/movie480.mp4?t=1741796719","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113347/movie_max.mp4?t=1741796719"},"name":"ReleaseTrai